#
# Conformance case: profiles/goal-budget-steps
# Budget governor: max_steps=2 caps the recursive ancestor query's native
# semi-naive fixpoint at 2 committed derivations. The chain a→b→c→d has 3
# ancestors of a; the native governor stops early and returns a sound partial
# subset with status "exhausted" — the backward-track step budget now runs on the
# native core (no Scryer/Nemo demotion), incomplete but never wrong.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/profiles/goal-budget-steps/> .
@prefix rdf:   <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

# Schema: sort used by the projection back-ends.
ex:Person a logic:Kind .
